data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_part.done","sequence_number":107,"item_id":"rs_0f645b0fb0dfd20f016aca065764048197abf7e25ac83e3e64","output_index":0,"summary_index":0,"part":{"type":"summary_text","text":"**Testing app rendering**\n\nI’m thinking about testing the fake DOM for a full app. I want to check how rendering behaves, specifically by replacing the last rendered line and ensuring global renderTasks are accessible through the VM context function. I'll implement a generic parser with regex and use querySelector to set default options.\n\nI’ll also need to override the fetch with a real mock for the body tasks. The plan is to inject the API via the fetch mock and pass the project through the VM function context. The code is around 180 lines."}}

